ste afwerking is dit model geschikt voor dagelijks gebruik en past het bij zowel casual als formele outfits.</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"274\" data-end=\"283\"><strong data-start=\"274\" data-end=\"283\">Staat</strong></p>\r\n<p data-start=\"285\" data-end=\"299\">In Nette Staat</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"301\" data-end=\"312\">⭐ Voordelen</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"314\" data-end=\"449\">• Stoer en modern Fossil design<br data-start=\"345\" data-end=\"348\">• Duidelijke analoge wijzerplaat<br data-start=\"380\" data-end=\"383\">• Betrouwbaar quartz uurwerk<br data-start=\"411\" data-end=\"414\">• Geschikt voor dagelijks gebruik</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"451\" data-end=\"467\">📋 Specificaties</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"469\" data-end=\"675\"><strong data-start=\"469\" data-end=\"478\">Merk:</strong> Fossil<br data-start=\"485\" data-end=\"488\"><strong data-start=\"488\" data-end=\"498\">Model:</strong> JR9517<br data-start=\"505\" data-end=\"508\"><strong data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"525\">Type uurwerk:</strong> Quartz<br data-start=\"532\" data-end=\"535\"><strong data-start=\"535\" data-end=\"547\">Display:</strong> Analoog<br data-start=\"555\" data-end=\"558\"><strong data-start=\"558\" data-end=\"577\">Materiaal kast:</strong> Roestvrij staal<br data-start=\"593\" data-end=\"596\"><strong data-start=\"596\" data-end=\"605\">Band:</strong> Horlogeband<br data-start=\"617\" data-end=\"620\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><strong data-start=\"620\" data-end=\"630\">Kleur:</strong> Zwart / Zilver<br data-start=\"645\" data-end=\"648\"><strong data-start=\"648\" data-end=\"658\">Staat:</strong> In Nette Staat</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"677\" data-end=\"691\">📦 Meegeleverd</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"693\" data-end=\"700\">Horloge</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"702\" data-end=\"720\">🛡️ Incl. Garantie</p>\r\n<p data-start=\"722\" data-end=\"754\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Incl. Garantie: 1 maand garantie</p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<div class=\"z-0 flex min-h-[46px] justify-start\"> </div>\r\n<div class=\"mt-3 w-full empty:hidden\">\r\n<div class=\"text-center\"> </div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</article>\r\n</div>",
